\f0\fs28 \cf2 Key Design Rules\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs20\fsmilli10115 \cf2 \cb3 - Dark background always\
- Monospace font for ALL numbers (tabular-nums)\
- 1px borders, very subtle (low opacity)\
- Uppercase + wide letter-spacing for labels\
- Glow effects: box-shadow with color at 20-30% opacity\
- Hover states: border color shifts to primary/cyan\
- Bar charts replace pie charts everywhere\
- No rounded corners > 12px\
- Spacing: tight (4-8px) for data, generous for section gaps\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

